  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 589a77387c7c4ea488d9368fe6c3cd2f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level 5 Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterName: Axion
  dialogues:
  - You have done amazing so far! Now, its time to finish the job.
  - Put all the components that you have build together to create the final transformer.
  - Feed both the input and output TOKENS in their own POSITIONAL EMBEDDER (Don't
    forget to set the correct weights!)
  - Then, feed the input EMBEDDING into the ENCODER.
  - Next, feed both the output EMBEDDING and the result of the ENCODER into the DECODER.
  - Finally, pass the result into one last NEURAL NETWORK, use the Pick Last building
    to get the final row of the output matrix, and apply a SOFTMAX function to it.
  - This final result will be the probabilities of the next output TOKEN in the sequence!
  - Good luck!
